hadiths[133]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1201","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Abd al-Rahman al-A'raj ne khabar di, ke unhon ne Abu Hurayrah ko farmate hue suna: Bad'tareen khana waleeme ka khana hai: us mein ameeron ko bulaya jata hai aur ghareebon ko roka jata hai; aur jo dawat qabool na kare us ne Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki nafarmani ki."
"1202","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Kaysan al-Yashkuri ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Hazim se, Abu Hurayrah se: ke ek shakhs ne Ansar ki ek aurat se nikah karna chaha, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne us se farmaya: Use dekh lo, kyunke Ansar ki auraton ki aankhon mein kuch hai. Al-Humaydi ne kaha: Muraad chhotapan hai."
"1203","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mis'ar ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Zurarah ibn Awfa se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Azza wa Jalla ne meri ummat se un ke dilon ke waswason ko muaf farma diya hai, jab tak wo us par amal na karen ya use zaban se na kahen."
"1204","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Sulayman ibn Dawud ne qasam khai aur kaha: Main aaj raat sattar biwiyon ke paas jaunga, un mein se har ek aisa beta jane gi jo Allah Azza wa Jalla ke raaste mein jihad kare. Un ke saathi yaani farishte ne un se kaha: Kahiye, agar Allah ne chaha. Magar wo bhool gaye, pas wo sattar biwiyon ke paas gaye, aur ek ke siwa kisi ne kuch na jana, jis ne aadha ladka jana. Phir Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Agar unhon ne kaha hota, agar Allah ne chaha, to wo apni qasam na todte, aur ye un ki haajat ke husool ka zariya hota."
"1205","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Hujayr al-Taymi ne hum se bayan kiya, Tawus se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi ki manind."
"1206","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Ya Rasool Allah, mere paas ek dinar hai? Aap ne farmaya: Use apne upar kharch karo. Us ne kaha: Mere paas ek aur hai. Aap ne farmaya: Use apne bachche par kharch karo. Us ne kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, mere paas ek aur hai. Aap ne farmaya: Use apne ghar walon par kharch karo. Us ne kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, mere paas ek aur hai. Aap ne farmaya: Use apne khadim par kharch karo. Us ne kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, mere paas ek aur hai. Aap ne farmaya: Tum behtar jante ho. Sa'id ne kaha: Phir Abu Hurayrah jab ye hadith bayan karte to kehte: Tumhara bachcha kehta hai: Mujh par kharch karo, tum mujhe kis ke hawale chhodoge? Tumhari biwi kehti hai: Mujh par kharch karo ya mujhe talaq do; tumhara khadim kehta hai: Mujh par kharch karo ya mujhe bech do."
"1207","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran ibn Zibyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Banu Hanifah ke ek shakhs se, ke unhon ne use kehte hue suna: Abu Hurayrah ne kaha: Kya tum Rajjal ko jante ho? Main ne kaha: Ji haan. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Aag mein us ki daadh Uhud se badi hogi. Wo Islam le aaya tha, phir murtad ho gaya aur Musaylimah se ja mila. Aur unhon ne kaha: Do mendhe lade, aur mujhe zyada mehboob hai ke mera mendha ghalib aaye."
"1208","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Suhayl ibn Abi Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasool Allah, kya hum Qayamat ke din apne Rab ko dekhenge? Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum dopahar ke waqt suraj ko dekhne mein takleef uthate ho jab badal na ho? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum chaand ki raat mein chaand ko dekhne mein takleef uthate ho jab badal na ho? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam Jis ke Hath mein meri jaan hai, tum apne Rab ko dekhne mein takleef nahin uthaoge magar jaisi tum in mein se ek ko dekhne mein uthate ho. Phir Wo bande se milega aur farmayega: Aye falan, kya Main ne tumhe izzat nahin di, tumhe sardar nahin banaya, tumhara nikah nahin karwaya, tumhare liye ghode aur oont musakhar nahin kiye, aur tumhe sardari karne aur chauthai lene ke liye nahin chhoda? Wo kahega: Kyun nahin, mere Rab. Wo farmayega: Kya tum samajhte the ke tum Mujh se miloge? Wo kahega: Nahin. Wo farmayega: Pas Main tumhe bhulata hun jaisa tum ne Mujhe bhulaya. Phir Wo doosre se milega aur isi tarah farmayega, aur wo isi tarah jawab dega. Phir Wo teesre se milega, jo kahega: Main Tujh par, Teri Kitab par aur Tere Rasool par iman laya; main ne namaz padhi, roza rakha aur sadqa diya, aur jitna ho saka khair ki ta'reef karega. Wo farmayega: To phir ye raha. Phir Wo farmayega: Kya Hum tumhare khilaf Apna gawah na bhejen? To wo dil mein sochega: Mere khilaf kaun gawahi dega? Phir us ka munh band kar diya jayega, aur us ki raan se kaha jayega: Bol, to us ki raan, gosht aur haddiyan us ke a'maal ke mutabiq bolengi; aur ye us par khud usi se hujjat qaim karne ke liye hai. Ye munafiq hai, aur yehi wo hai jis par Allah Ta'ala naraz hai. Phir pukarne wala pukarega: Har ummat us ke peeche jaye jis ki wo Allah Azza wa Jalla ke siwa ibadat karti thi; pas shayateen aur saleeben aur un ke pairukar Jahannam ki taraf jayenge. Unhon ne farmaya: Aur hum baqi reh jayenge, hum mo'mineen. Phir hamara Rab hamare paas aayega, aur Wohi hamara Rab hai, aur hamein badla dega, aur farmayega: Ye yahan kyun hain? Wo kahenge: Hum Allah ke momin bande hain; hum Allah par iman laye aur Us ke saath kisi ko shareek nahin karte; ye hamara muqam hai yahan tak ke hamara Rab hamare paas aaye, aur Wohi hamara Rab hai, aur Woh hamein badla dega. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir Wo chalta rahega hatta ke Pul par aayega, jis par aag ke kande hain jo logon ko uchak lete hain; us waqt shafa'at ki ijazat hogi, Aye Allah salamati de, Aye Allah salamati de. Jab wo Pul se guzar jayenge, to jo koi apne maal mein se jo us ke dayen hath ki milkiyat hai Allah ke raaste mein joda kharch kare, Jannat ka har darban use pukarega: Aye Allah ke bande, aye Musalman, ye khair hai, pas aao. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Abu Bakr Allah un se raazi hon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasool Allah, beshak ye banda koi nuqsan nahin uthata: wo koi darwaza nahin chhodta magar doosre se dakhil hota hai. Unhon ne kaha: To Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne unhe apne hath se thapka, phir farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam Jis ke Hath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, beshak mujhe ummeed hai ke tum unhi mein se ho."
"1209","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Qayamat is haal mein aayegi ke do aadmi kapde ka sauda kar rahe honge, na bei' poori hogi na use lapeta hoga."
"1210","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe us shakhs ne khabar di jis ne Abu Hurayrah se suna, kehte hue: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak Jannat mein ek darakht hai jis ke saaye mein sawaar so saal chalta rahega aur use paar na karega. Aur agar chaho to padho: Aur phaila hua saya. Aur fajr ki namaz mein raat ke farishte aur din ke farishte hazir hote hain. Aur agar chaho to padho: Aur fajr ki qirat; beshak fajr ki qirat hazir ki jati hai."
"1211","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab raat ka khana rakh diya jaye aur namaz khadi ho jaye, to raat ke khane se shuru karo. Sufyan ne kaha: Aur maine jab raat ka khana rakh diya jaye kehte hue kisi ko nahi suna siwaye al-Zuhri ke."
"1212","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Madinah tashreef laye jab main das baras ka tha, aur un ki wafat hui jab main bees baras ka tha. Meri walidahen mujhe un ki khidmat par ubharti thin. Woh hamare ghar tashreef laye, aur hum ne un ke liye apni ghar ki bakri se doodh doha, aur use ghar ke kunwen ke pani se milaya gaya. Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne nosh farmaya, jabke Abu Bakr un ke baen janib the aur ek dehati un ke daen janib, aur Umar ek taraf the. Umar ne kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, Abu Bakr ko dijiye. To Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne dehati ko diya aur farmaya: Daen wala, phir daen wala."
"1213","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Aapas me talluq na todo, ek dusre se munh na phero, ek dusre se bughz na rakho, ek dusre se hasad na karo; aur Allah ke bande, bhai bhai ban jao. Aur kisi Musalman ke liye halal nahi ke apne bhai ko teen din se zyada chhore. Sufyan se kaha gaya: Aur najsh me bhi nahi? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi."
"1214","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wail ibn Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, apne bete Bakr ibn Wail se, al-Zuhri se, Anas ibn Malik se: ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Safiyyah ka waleema sattu aur khajuron se kiya. Sufyan ne kaha: Aur maine al-Zuhri ko use bayan karte hue suna lekin mujhe yaad na raha; aur Bakr ibn Wail hamare sath al-Zuhri ke paas baitha karte the."
"1215","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tumbe aur qalakhti bartan me nabidh na banao."
"1216","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: ‘Abd Allah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn ‘Amr ibn Hazm ne hum se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Mayyit ke pichhe us ki qabr tak teen cheezen jati hain: us ke ghar wale, us ka maal, aur us ke a‘mal; do wapas laut aate hain aur ek baqi rehta hai: us ke ghar wale aur maal wapas laut aate hain, aur us ke a‘mal baqi rehte hain."
"1217","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qasim Musafir ne hum se san ek sau bees me bayan kiya, jab main terah baras, char mah aur aadhe mah ka tha, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Banu al-Najjar ke ek khandar me qazaye hajat ke irade se dakhil hue, aur ghabraye hue — ya unhon ne kaha dare hue — bahar tashreef laye, farmate hue: Agar ye na hota ke tum ek dusre ko dafan na karoge to main Allah ‘Azza wa Jalla se dua karta ke tumhen ahl-e-qubur ke ‘azab me se woh sunaye jo Us ne mujhe sunaya hai."
"1218","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko meri aakhri nazar dekhna ye tha jab Aap ne peer ke din parda uthaya, jabke log Abu Bakr ke pichhe safon me the. Jab unhon ne Aap ko dekha to jaise hilne lage, to Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne unhen ishara farmaya ke qayam raho. Main ne Aap ke chehre ko dekha goya woh mushaf ka waraq ho. Aap ne parda gira diya, aur usi din ke aakhir me Aap ki wafat ho gayi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam."
"1219","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Anas ibn Malik kehte hain: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ghore se gir pare aur Aap ki daen pahlu chhil gayi, to hum Aap ki ‘iyadat ke liye hazir hue. Namaz ka waqt aaya, to Aap ne humein baithe hue namaz parhayi, aur hum ne Aap ke pichhe baithe hue namaz parhi. Jab Aap apni namaz se farigh hue to farmaya: Imam sirf is liye banaya gaya hai ke us ki pairwi ki jaye: jab woh takbeer kahe to takbeer kaho; jab woh ruku‘ kare to ruku‘ karo; jab woh uthe to utho; jab woh kahe ‘Allah ne us ki sun li jis ne Us ki hamd ki’ to kaho: Ya Allah, hamare Rab, Tere hi liye hamd hai; jab woh sajda kare to sajda karo; aur jab woh baithe hue namaz parhe to sab baithe hue parho."
"1220","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat me hazir hua aur Aap se Qayamat ke bare me sawal kiya. Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne us ke liye kya tayyar kiya hai? Us ne zyada kuch zikr na kiya siwa is ke ke us ne kaha: Main Allah aur Us ke Rasool se muhabbat karta hun. To Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tum usi ke sath ho jis se tum muhabbat karte ho. Abu ‘Ali ne kaha: Main ne al-Humaydi ko kehte hue suna: Ibn ‘Uyaynah ne chhiyasi Tabi‘in se mulaqat ki, aur woh kehte the: Main ne Ayyub jaisa nahi dekha. Al-Humaydi ne kaha: Sufyan ne kaha: Aur al-Zuhri ke alfaz, jab unhon ne hum se Anas aur Sahl se bayan kiya, ye the: Main ne suna, main ne suna."
"1221","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir ne hum se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath Madinah me Zuhr chaar rak'at parhi, aur main ne Aap ke sath Dhu al-Hulayfah me Asr do rak'at parhi."
"1222","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Qilabah se, Anas ibn Malik se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, pichli riwayat ki manind."
"1223","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim ibn Maysarah ne hum se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath Madinah me Zuhr chaar rak'at parhi, aur main ne Aap ke sath Dhu al-Hulayfah me Asr do rak'at parhi."
"1224","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talhah ne hum se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Main ne ek yateem ladke ke hamrah Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke peeche hamare ghar me namaz parhi, aur meri walida Umm Sulaym hamare peeche thin."
"1225","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Anas ibn Malik se suna, jinhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Ansar ko Bahrain me zameenen ata karne ke liye bulaya, to unhon ne kaha: Nahi jab tak Aap hamare Muhajir bhaiyon ko bhi usi tarah ata na farmayen, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Mere baad tum khudgharzana tarjeeh dekhoge, pas sabr karo yahan tak ke tum mujh se milo."
"1226","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Ek dehati ne masjid me peshab kar diya aur log use ghoorne lage, to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne unhen rok diya aur farmaya: Us par paani ka ek dol baha do."
"1227","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ansar ke sab se behtar ghar Banu al-Najjar ka ghar hai, phir Banu Abd al-Ashhal ka ghar, phir Banu al-Harith ibn al-Khazraj ka ghar, phir Banu Sa'idah ka ghar, aur farmaya: Ansar ke tamam gharon me khair hai."
"1228","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Sirin se, Anas ibn Malik se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Jumeraat ki subah sawere Khaybar aaye; unhon ne qila khol diya tha aur apne phavdon ke sath us se bahar nikle the, aur jab unhon ne Aap ko dekha to qile ki taraf daud pade, kehte hue: Muhammad aur lashkar, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allahu Akbar, Allahu Akbar, aur Aap ne apne hath buland kiye: Khaybar tabah hua; jab hum kisi qaum ke sahan me utarte hain to darae huon ki subah buri hoti hai."
"1229","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas ibn Malik se, jinhon ne kaha: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam, Abu Bakr, Umar aur Uthman qiraat ka aaghaz Alhamdu lillahi Rabbil Alameen se farmaya karte the."
"1230","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Sirin se, Anas ibn Malik se, jinhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Khaybar fatah kiya to hum ne basti ke bahar gadhe paye aur unhen zibah kiya aur un me se kuch pakaye, to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke munadi ne elaan kiya: Beshak Allah aur Us ke Rasul tumhen us se mana farmate hain, kyunke ye shaitan ke kaam se rijs hai, pas degchen un me jo kuch tha us samet ulat di gayin jabke wo josh maar rahi thin."
"1231","Al-Humaidi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali ibn Zayd ibn Jud'an ne hum se bayan kiya, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Agar log ek waadi mein chalen aur Ansar ek ghati mein chalen to mein Ansar ki ghati mein chalunga, aur agar Hijrat na hoti to mein Ansar ka ek fard hota, aur Ansar mera raazdaan aur meri amanat hain, pas un mein se jo neki kare us ke sath neki karo aur jo un mein se bura kare us se darguzar karo, Ibn Jud'an ne kaha: Aur al-Hasan ne mere liye is mein izafa kiya: Magar muqarrar hadd ki saza mein."
"1232","Al-Humaidi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jud'an ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Meine Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Abu Talha apna tarqash Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke samne bikhair dete the, apne ghutnon par jhuke hue aur kehte the: Mera chehra aap ke chehre ke liye dhaal hai aur meri jaan aap ki jaan par qurban hai, Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Lashkar mein Abu Talha ki awaaz mardon ki ek jama'at se behtar hai, Anas ne kaha: Aur meine Ibn Umm Maktum ko un ki ek jang mein Musalmanon ka jhanda uthaye hue dekha."
"1233","Al-Humaidi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jud'an ne hum se bayan kiya, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Ukaydir Duma ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko ek jubba tohfe mein diya to log us ki khubsurti par hairan hue to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jannat mein Sa'd ibn Mu'adh ke rumal is se behtar hain."
"1234","Al-Humaidi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jud'an ne hum se bayan kiya, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke huzoor shafa'at ka zikr hua to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Mein Jannat ke halqe ko pakrunga aur use khadkhadaunga."
"1235","Hum se Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Asim al-Ahwal ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne hamare ghar mein Muhajirun aur Ansar ke darmiyan bhai chara qaim farmaya. Un se kaha gaya: kya Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne nahi farmaya: Islam mein koi hilf nahi? To Anas ne ise dohraya aur kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne hamare ghar mein Muhajirun aur Ansar ke darmiyan bhai chara qaim farmaya. Sufyan ne kaha: ulama ne is ki tashreeh ki: unhon ne hilf qaim kiya yaani unhon ne unhein bhai bhai bana diya."
"1236","Hum se Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Jarir ibn Abd al-Hamid al-Dabbi ne bayan kiya, al-Mughirah ibn Miqsam al-Dabbi se, apne walid se, Shubah ibn al-Tawam se, unhon ne kaha: Qays ibn Asim ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se ahlaf ke bare mein pucha, to Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Islam mein koi hilf nahi, lekin zamana-e-jahiliyyat ke ahlaf ko mazbuti se thamay rakho."
"1237","Hum se Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Asim al-Ahwal ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko kisi sariyya par itna ghamgeen kabhi nahi dekha jitna Bir Maunah ke sathiyon par jab wo shaheed kiye gaye ghamgeen hue; aur unhein Qura kaha jata tha."
"1238","Hum se Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulayman al-Taymi ne kaha: sab se pehli cheez jo hum ne un se suni, unhon ne kaha: main ne Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke samne do aadmiyon ko chheenk aayi, to Aap ne un mein se ek ko Yarhamukallah kaha aur dusre ko Yarhamukallah nahi kaha, to us ne arz kiya: Ya Rasool Allah, aap ne use to Yarhamukallah kaha lekin mujhe Yarhamukallah nahi kaha. To Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: is ne Alhamdulillah kaha, jabke tum ne Alhamdulillah nahi kaha."
"1239","Hum se Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sulayman al-Taymi ne bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne apne khadim se farmaya: aahista, sheeshe ke bartanon ko narmi se le chal, yaani auraton ko."
"1240","Hum se Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sulayman al-Taymi ne bayan kiya, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: main Ansar mein se apne kuch chachaon ki khidmat mein khara unhein khajoor ki sharaab pila raha tha, ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki taraf se ghabrahat mein ek aadmi hamare paas aaya. Hum ne kaha: kya muamla hai? Us ne kaha: sharaab haram kar di gayi hai. To unhon ne mujh se kaha: ise baha de, Anas. To main ne ise baha diya. Al-Nadr ibn Anas ne kaha: us din yehi un ki sharaab thi."
"1241","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa ibn Uqbah ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Abi Bakr al-Thaqafi se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Hum is din subah Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath Mina se Arafah ki taraf rawana hue; hum me se koi takbeer kehta tha aur koi talbiyah kehta tha, aur hum me se koi dusre par is par e'teraz nahi karta tha."
"1242","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ibn Anas ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Anas ibn Malik se: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Fatah wale saal Makkah me dakhil hue jabke Aap ke sar par khud tha."
"1243","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ibn Anas ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talhah se, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko pyale me se kaddu chun chun kar khate hue dekha, aur us waqt se main us se mohabbat karta hun."
"1244","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humayd al-Tawil ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Qatadah ko Anas ibn Malik se puchte hue suna: Kya Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam anguthi pehente the? Unhon ne kaha: Haan; goya main chaandni raat me Aap ke hath par us ki chamak dekh raha hun."
"1245","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko suna jabke main Abu Talhah ke peeche sawar tha, Aap farma rahe the: Hazir hun, Hajj aur Umrah dono ke sath."
"1246","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mus'ab ibn Sulaym, jo Banu Zuhrah ke katib the, ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas ibn Malik ko Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se is riwayat ki manind riwayat karte hue suna."
"1247","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne pachhne lagwaye; Banu Bayadah nami Ansari khandan ke Abu Taybah nami ek ghulam ne Aap ko pachhne lagaye, aur Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne unhen ek sa' ya do sa' ya ek mudd ya do mudd diye, aur Aap ne un ke aaqaon se baat ki to unhon ne un ka mahsul kam kar diya, yani un ka kharaj."
"1248","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humayd al-Tawil ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Jab Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Madinah tashreef laye to logon ne rehaishon ke liye qura'a andazi ki, aur Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf ka qura'a Sa'd ibn al-Rabi' ke yahan nikla; Sa'd ne un se kaha: Aao, main apna maal tumhare sath taqseem karunga, aur apni dono biwiyon me se jise tum chaho tumhare liye chhor dunga, aur tumhen mehnat se be-niyaz kar dunga; Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf ne un se kaha: Allah tumhare ahl aur tumhare maal me tumhen barkat de; mujhe bazaar bata do; pas woh nikle aur kuchh kamaya, phir ek aurat ko paigham diya aur us se nikah kar liya, aur Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne un se farmaya: Tum ne us se kitne mahar par nikah kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Khajoor ki guthli ke wazan ke barabar sone ke badle; Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Walima karo, chahe ek bakri hi ho."
"1249","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne masjid me qible ki taraf balgham dekha to use khurach diya, phir ghusse me logon ki taraf mutawajjeh hue aur farmaya: Kya tum me se koi ye pasand karta hai ke us ke chehre par thuka jaye? Phir farmaya: Jab banda namaz me khada hota hai to woh apne Rab ke samne hota hai, pas woh apne samne na thuke aur na apne dayen taraf, balke apne bayen taraf ya apne bayen qadam ke neeche thuke; aur agar achanak kuchh aa jaye to use apne kapde me le kar is tarah lapet le; aur al-Humaydi ne apne kapde ke kinare ki taraf ishara kiya aur use masaal diya."
"1250","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Hassan al-Qardusi ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Sirin se, Anas ibn Malik se: Jab Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Jamrah ko kankariyan marien aur apni qurbani zibah ki to Aap ne apna dayan hissa hajjam ko diya, us ne use munda, phir Aap ne use apna bayan hissa diya, us ne use munda, phir Aap ne use Abu Talhah ko de diya aur unhen hukm farmaya ke use logon me taqseem kar den."
"1251","Hum se Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Musab ibn Sulaym ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas khajooren layi gayin to Aap simat kar jaldi mein baithe hue taqseem farmane lage, jaldi jaldi shoq se khate hue."
"1252","Hum se Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Amr ibn Dinar aur Abu al-Zubayr ne bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: ek aadmi ne apne ek ghulam ladke ko apni maut ke baad aazad kiya, jabke us ke paas is ke siwa koi maal na tha, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne use farokht kar diya, aur use Nuaym ibn al-Nahham ne khareed liya. Amr ibn Dinar ne kaha: Jabir ne kaha: ek Qibti ghulam jo Ibn al-Zubayr ki hukumat ke pehle saal mein faut hua. Abu al-Zubayr ne izafa kiya: us ka naam Yaqub Qibti tha."
"1253","Hum se Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Amr ibn Dinar aur Abu al-Zubayr ne bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: ek aadmi masjid mein dakhil hua jabke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam jumma ke din mimbar par khare khutba de rahe the, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne us se farmaya: kya tum ne namaz padhi hai? Us ne kaha: nahi. Aap ne farmaya: to do rakat padho. Sufyan ne kaha: apni riwayat mein Abu al-Zubayr ne us aadmi ka naam Sulayk ibn Amr al-Ghatafani bataya."
"1254","Hum se Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Hassan ibn Jadah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne al-Hasan ibn Abi al-Hasan ko dekha ke wo jumma ke din Wasit ki masjid mein dakhil hue jabke Ibn Hubayrah mimbar par khutba de rahe the, to unhon ne do rakat padhin phir baithe."
"1255","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya aur kaha: Main ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Hudaybiyah ke din hum ek hazar chaar sau thay, aur Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne hum se farmaya: Aaj tum zameen walon mein sab se behtar ho, Jabir ne kaha: Agar meri beenai hoti to main tumhen darakht ki jagah dikhata."
"1256","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Hamid ibn Jubayr ibn Shaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Muhammad ibn Abbad ibn Ja'far al-Makhzumi ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Jabir ibn Abdullah al-Ansari se kaha jabke woh Baitullah ka tawaf kar rahe thay: Kya Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Jumu'ah ke din roza rakhne se mana farmaya hai, unhon ne kaha: Haan, is Ghar ke Rabb ki qasam."
"1257","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujh se farmaya: Jabir, kya tum ne nikah kiya hai, main ne kaha: Ji haan, Aap ne farmaya: Kunwari se ya pehle se shadi shuda aurat se, main ne kaha: Pehle se shadi shuda aurat se, Aap ne farmaya: Kisi chhoti ladki se kyun nahin jis se tum khelte aur woh tum se khelti, main ne kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, mere walid Uhud ke din shaheed kar diye gaye aur nau betiyan chhodin to woh mere liye nau behnen ban gayin, aur main ne un ke sath un jaisi nadan chhoti ladki jama karna pasand na kiya balke ek aisi aurat jo un ke baal kanghi kare aur un ki dekh bhaal kare, Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne durust kiya."
"1258","Sufyan ne kaha: Phir meri mulaqat Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir se hui aur unhon ne mujh se yehi bayan kiya, ek lafz ke izafe ke sath jo Amr ne nahin kaha tha, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujh se mere nikah ke waqt farmaya: Jabir, kya tum ne gadday hasil kiye hain, main ne kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, hamare paas gadday kahan se hote, Aap ne farmaya: Anqareeb ye ho jayenge."
"1259","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se koi cheez bhi kabhi nahin mangi gayi ke Aap ne farmaya ho: Nahin."
"1260","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir ne hum se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Main beemar pad gaya, aur Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam aur Abu Bakr paidal meri iyadat ke liye tashreef laye, mujh par behoshi tari ho gayi, to Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne pani mangwaya, wuzu farmaya, phir use mujh par baha diya to mujhe hosh aa gaya, main ne kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, main apne maal ka faisla kis tarah karun, main apne maal ke sath kya karun, Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam khamosh rahe yahan tak ke wirasat ki ayat nazil hui."
"1261","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Mere baare mein wirasat ki aayat nazil hui. Abu Bakr ne kaha: Sufyan ne ise Abu al-Zubayr se nahin suna."
"1262","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Khandaq ke din logon ko pukara to al-Zubayr ne apne aap ko pesh kiya, phir unhon ne unhein dobara pukara to al-Zubayr ne apne aap ko pesh kiya, phir unhon ne unhein dobara pukara to al-Zubayr ne apne aap ko pesh kiya, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Har Nabi ka ek hawari hota hai, aur mera hawari al-Zubayr hai. Aur Sufyan ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwah ne izafa kiya: Aur meri khala ka beta."
"1263","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Muhalle mein ek ladka paida hua aur us ke baap ne us ka naam al-Qasim rakha, to hum ne us ke baap se kaha: Hum tumhein Abu al-Qasim nahin kahenge aur na hi is se tumhari aankh thandi karenge. To us ka baap Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein hazir hua, to Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne us se farmaya: Apne bete ka naam Abd al-Rahman rakho."
"1264","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ali ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Maine Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujh se farmaya: Ae Jabir, jab Bahrain ka maal aayega to main tumhein is tarah aur is tarah aur is tarah dunga. Phir Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Bahrain ka maal aane se pehle wafaat pa gaye, aur wo Abu Bakr ki khilafat mein aaya, to Abu Bakr ne ek munadi ko hukum diya jis ne elaan kiya: Jis ka Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam par koi qarz ho ya koi wada ho wo aaye. Jabir ne kaha: To main Abu Bakr ke paas aaya aur un se kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya tha: Jab Bahrain ka maal aayega to main tumhein is tarah aur is tarah aur is tarah dunga. To Abu Bakr ne mere liye ek baar bharkar nikala, phir mujh se kaha: Ise gin lo. Maine ise gina to wo paanch sau nikla, aur unhon ne kaha: Is jaisa do baar aur le lo."
"1265","Sufyan ne kaha: Phir maine Ibn al-Munkadir ko bayan karte hue suna ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko isi tarah kehte hue suna, siwae is ke ke unhon ne kaha: To us ne mere liye teen baar bharkar nikala. Aur Ibn al-Munkadir ne izafa kiya: Jabir ne kaha: Phir main is ke baad Abu Bakr ke paas aaya aur un se kaha: Mujhe do, lekin unhon ne mujhe nahin diya, phir main un ke paas aaya aur kaha: Mujhe do, lekin unhon ne mujhe nahin diya, phir main un ke paas aaya aur kaha: Mujhe do, lekin unhon ne mujhe nahin diya, to maine kaha: Ae Abu Bakr, maine tum se manga aur tum ne mujhe nahin diya, phir maine tum se manga aur tum ne mujhe nahin diya, to ya to mujhe do ya mujh se bakheeli karo. Unhon ne kaha: Tum ne kaha: Mujh se bakheeli karo? Aur bakhl se badh kar kaun si beemari hai? Jab bhi maine tumhein rok kar nahin diya to sirf tumhein dene ka irada rakhte hue rok kar nahin diya."
"1266","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zubayr ne hum se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne ungliyan chaatne aur bartan chaatne ka hukum farmaya. Unhon ne kaha: Aur unhon ne farmaya: Insaan nahin jaanta ke is ke kis hisse mein barkat hai."
"1267","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya: Maine Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Main Jannat mein dakhil hua aur us mein ek mahal ya ek ghar dekha, aur maine kaha: Ye kiska hai? Kaha gaya: Ye Umar ibn al-Khattab ka hai. Ae Abu Hafs, agar tumhari ghairat na hoti to main is mein zaroor dakhil hota. Unhon ne kaha: To Umar ro pade aur kaha: Kya aap par ghairat ki jayegi, ae Allah ke Rasool?"
"1268","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Munkadir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Main Jannat mein dakhil hua aur us mein ek mahal ya ek ghar dekha, aur maine us mein ek aahat suni, aur maine kaha: Ye kiska hai? Kaha gaya: Ye Quraish ke ek mard ka hai, aur mujhe ummeed hui ke wo main hun, lekin kaha gaya: Ye Umar ibn al-Khattab ka hai. Ae Abu Hafs, agar tumhari ghairat na hoti to main is mein zaroor dakhil hota. Unhon ne kaha: To Umar ro pade aur kaha: Kya aap par ghairat ki jayegi, ae Allah ke Rasool?"
"1269","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jang fareb hai."
"1270","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne kaha: Khudaah, jabke Madina wale Khadaah kehte hain."
"1271","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko farmate hue suna: Hum Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath ek ghazwa mein thay jab Muhajirun mein se ek shakhs ne Ansar mein se ek shakhs ko thokar mari, to Ansari ne kaha: Ai Ansar! Aur Muhajir ne kaha: Ai Muhajirun! To Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne ise suna aur farmaya: Ye kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Muhajirun mein se ek shakhs ne Ansar mein se ek shakhs ko thokar mari; Ansari ne kaha: Ai Ansar, aur Muhajir ne kaha: Ai Muhajirun. To Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jahiliyat ki is pukar ka kya kaam hai? Ise chhor do, pas beshak wo gandi hai. Abdullah ibn Ubayy ibn Salul ne kaha: Kya unhon ne ye kiya hai? Allah ki qasam, agar hum Madina ki taraf laute to izzat wala zaroor zillat wale ko us se nikal dega. Jabir ne farmaya: Jab Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam tashreef laye to Madina mein Ansar Muhajirun se tadad mein zyada thay, phir is ke baad Muhajirun barh gaye. Unhon ne farmaya: To Umar ne kaha: Mujhe is munafiq ki gardan marne dijiye. Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ise chhor do, kahin log ye baat na karne lagen ke Muhammad apne sathiyon ko qatl karta hai."
"1272","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abu Harun Al-Madani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abdullah ibn Abdullah ibn Ubayy ibn Salul ne apne walid se kaha: Allah ki qasam, tum hargiz Madina mein dakhil nahi hoge jab tak ye na kaho: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam izzat wale hain aur main zillat wala hun. Unhon ne farmaya: Aur wo Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein hazir hue aur arz kiya: Ai Allah ke Rasool, mujhe ye baat pahunchi hai ke aap mere walid ko qatl karne ka irada rakhte hain; qasam hai Us Zaat ki Jis ne aap ko haq ke sath bheja, main ne un ke rob ki wajah se kabhi un ke chehre ki taraf nahi dekha, aur agar aap chahen ke main aap ki khidmat mein un ka sar le aaun to main use aap ki khidmat mein le aaunga, kyunke main apne walid ke qatil ko dekhna napasand karta hun."
"1273","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Muhammad ibn Al-Munkadir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko farmate hue suna: Ek dehati Madina aaya aur Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein hijrat par baiat ki, phir use bukhar ho gaya aur wo Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur arz kiya: Ai Allah ke Rasool, meri baiat khatm farma dijiye. Unhon ne farmaya: Nahin. Jab bukhar shadeed ho gaya to wo Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur arz kiya: Ai Allah ke Rasool, meri baiat khatm farma dijiye. Unhon ne farmaya: Nahin. Phir bukhar shadeed ho gaya aur wo Madina se bhag kar nikal gaya, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Madina bhatti ki manind hai; wo apna khot bahar nikal deta hai aur apne khare ko pak saaf kar deta hai."
"1274","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko farmate hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne hamen teen sau sawar ke sath bheja, hamare sardar Abu Ubaydah ibn Al-Jarrah thay, Quraysh ke ek qafile ko rokne ke liye; hamen shadeed bhook lagi yahan tak ke hum ne darakhton ke patte khaye, aur us lashkar ka naam Patton Wala Lashkar rakha gaya. Unhon ne farmaya: Samundar ne hamare liye, jabke hum sahil par thay, ek janwar bahar phenka jise ambar machhli kaha jata hai; hum ne us mein se aadha mahina khaya, use salan banaya aur us ki charbi apne jismon par mali yahan tak ke hamare jism bhar gaye. Unhon ne farmaya: Abu Ubaydah ne us ki ek pasli li aur use khara kar diya, phir lashkar mein se sab se lambe qad wale shakhs aur sab se bade oont ko talash kiya aur use hukm diya ke wo oont par sawar ho phir us ke neeche se guzre, aur us ne aisa hi kiya aur us ke neeche se guzar gaya. Phir hum Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein hazir hue aur unhen khabar di, to unhon ne farmaya: Kya tumhare pas us mein se kuch hai? Hum ne kaha: Nahin."
"1275","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, isi mafhoom ki riwayat hai, is izafe ke sath: Hamare darmiyan ek shakhs tha jis ke paas khajooron ka ek thaila tha, woh us mein se hamein ek mutthi deta tha, phir muamla ek khajoor tak aa pahuncha, aur jab woh khatm ho gayin to hamein us ki kami mehsoos hui."
"1276","Abu Bakr al-Humaydi ne kaha: Sufyan ne ise Abu al-Zubayr se nahin suna, unhon ne kaha: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, Jabir se, ke unhon ne unhein kehte hue suna: Hamare darmiyan ek shakhs tha, aur jab bhook sakht ho gayi to us ne teen oont zibah kiye, phir us ne teen oont zibah kiye, phir us ne teen oont zibah kiye, phir Abu Ubaydah ibn al-Jarrah ne use mana farmaya."
"1277","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ne hamein khabar di, Abu Salih se, Qays ibn Sa'd ibn Ubadah se, unhon ne kaha: Maine apne walid se kaha: Main ek lashkar mein tha, Lashkar-e-Khabt mein, aur logon ko bhook lagi, to mere walid ne mujh se farmaya: Zibah karo, Maine kaha: Maine zibah kiya, phir unhein sakht bhook lagi aur mere walid ne mujh se farmaya: Zibah karo, Maine kaha: Maine zibah kiya, phir unhein sakht bhook lagi aur mere walid ne mujh se farmaya: Zibah karo, phir mere walid ne farmaya: Zibah karo, Maine kaha: Mujhe mana kar diya gaya."
"1278","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Jabir ibn Abdullah ko apne dono kaanon ki taraf ishara karte hue suna: Main gawahi deta hun ke maine apne in dono kaanon se Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Kuch log Aag se nikal kar Jannat mein dakhil honge."
"1279","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Mu'adh ibn Jabal Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath Isha padhte the, phir wapas ja kar apni qaum ko wohi namaz padhate the, unhon ne kaha: Ek raat Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Isha mein takheer farmayi, unhon ne kaha: To Mu'adh ne Aap ke sath woh padhi, phir wapas ja kar apni qaum ki imamat ki, Surah Al-Baqarah se qiraat shuru ki, to un ke peeche ek shakhs alag ho gaya, akele namaz padhi, phir chala gaya, logon ne us se kaha: Tu munafiq ho gaya, us ne kaha: Nahin, lekin main Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein jaunga aur Aap ko khabar dunga, phir woh Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein aaya aur arz kiya: Ya Rasool Allah, pichhli raat Aap ne Isha mein takheer farmayi, aur Mu'adh ne Aap ke sath woh padhi, phir wapas aa kar hamari imamat ki, Surah Al-Baqarah se shuru kiya, jab Maine ye dekha to main peeche hat gaya aur akele namaz padhi, kyunke hum pani dhone wale oonton wale log hain, apne hathon se kaam karte hain, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Mu'adh ki taraf mutawajjeh hue aur farmaya: Kya tum fitne mein dalne wale ho, Mu'adh, kya tum fitne mein dalne wale ho, falan surah padho aur falan surah padho, aur unhon ne suratein ginwayin, Sufyan ne kaha: Aur Abu al-Zubayr ne is mein ye izafa kiya ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Sabbihisma Rabbikal A'la padho, Wal-Laili Iza Yaghsha, Was-Sama'i Zatil Buruj, Wash-Shamsi wa Duhaha, Was-Sama'i Wat-Tariq, Sufyan ne kaha: To Maine Amr ibn Dinar se kaha: Abu al-Zubayr kehte hain: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Sabbihisma Rabbikal A'la padho, Wal-Laili Iza Yaghsha, Wash-Shamsi wa Duhaha, Was-Sama'i Wat-Tariq, Was-Sama'i Zatil Buruj, Amr ne kaha: Yehi hai ya is jaisa."
"1280","Bishr ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Abdullah ibn Ubayy ibn Salul ke paas tashreef laye jab use us ki qabr mein rakh diya gaya tha, unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne hukm farmaya ke use nikala jaye, use apne ghutnon par rakha, use apni qamees pehnayi, aur apne luaab mein se kuch us par phoonka, aur Allah behtar janta hai."
"1281","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Harun Musa ibn Abi Isa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Abdullah ibn Ubayy ne un se kaha, jab ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne do qameesen pehen rakhi thin: Ya Rasul Allah, inhen woh qamees pehna dijiye jo aap ke jism se lagti hai."
"1282","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Uhud ke din ek shakhs Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein aaya aur arz kiya: Ya Rasul Allah, mujhe bataiye, agar main Allah ki rah mein larta rahun yahan tak ke qatal kar diya jaun to main kahan hunga? Aap ne farmaya: Jannat mein. Unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne chand khajooren jo un ke haath mein thin phenk din, phir larte rahe yahan tak ke qatal kar diye gaye."
"1283","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ka'b ibn al-Ashraf se kaun nimtega? Us ne Allah aur Us ke Rasul ko takleef di hai. Muhammad ibn Maslamah ne arz kiya: Ya Rasul Allah, kya aap pasand farmayenge ke main use qatal kar dun? Aap ne farmaya: Han. Unhon ne kaha: Phir mujhe ijazat dijiye. To Aap ne unhen ijazat de di, aur Muhammad ibn Maslamah Ka'b ke pas gaye aur kaha: Is shakhs ne hum se sadqa talab kiya hai aur hum par bojh dala hai, aur main aap se qarz lene aaya hun. Us ne kaha: Aur is par mazeed, Allah ki qasam, tum zaroor us se ukta jaoge. Muhammad ibn Maslamah ne kaha: Hum ne us ki pairwi ki hai aur hum use chhorna napasand karte hain yahan tak ke dekhen ke us ka muamla kya rukh ikhtiyar karta hai. Us ne kaha: Mujhe koi cheez girwi rakho. Unhon ne kaha: Hum aap ke pas kya girwi rakhen? Us ne kaha: Mujhe apne bete girwi rakho? Muhammad ne us se kaha: Hum mein se kisi ke bete ko ar dilayi jayegi, us ke bare mein kaha jayega: Do khajoor ke bojh ke badle girwi rakha gaya. Us ne kaha: Phir apni aurten. Unhon ne kaha: Aap Arab ke sab se khubsurat hain; kya hum apni aurten aap ke pas girwi rakhen? Balke hum aap ke pas hathiyar girwi rakhenge. Us ne kaha: Han, aur us ne us ke pas aane ka wada kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Woh char the; Amr ne un mein se do ke naam liye: Muhammad ibn Maslamah aur Abu Na'ilah. Woh us ke pas aaye jab ke woh lipta hua tha, us se khushbu ki mehak aa rahi thi. Unhon ne kaha: Hum ne aaj ki raat jaisi khushgawar khushbu kabhi nahin sunghi. Us ne kaha: Mere pas falan falan khatun hain, Arab ki sab se zyada khushbu lagane wali. Muhammad ne kaha: Mujhe sunghne ki ijazat dijiye. Us ne kaha: Sunghiye. Phir unhon ne kaha: Mujhe wapas lautne ki ijazat dijiye. Unhon ne kaha: To woh laute, us ka sar pakar liya, aur kaha: Us par war karo. To unhon ne us par war kiya yahan tak ke use qatal kar diya."
"1284","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Ubayshi ne hum se bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, unhon ne kaha: Un ki ahliya ne un se kaha: Main ek awaz sun rahi hun jis mein mujhe khun ki bu mehsoos hoti hai. Unhon ne kaha: Yeh to Abu Na'ilah hai, mera bhai; agar us ne mujhe soya hua paya hota to woh mujhe na jagata, aur sakhi shakhs, agar use neze ke war ki taraf pukara jaye to woh jawab deta hai. Aur jo log us ke pas aaye the un ke naam yeh hain: Muhammad ibn Maslamah, Abu Na'ilah, Abbad ibn Bishr, Abu Abs ibn Jabr, aur al-Harith ibn Mu'adh."
"1285","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Amr ibn Dinar se kaha: Kya aap ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne ek shakhs se jo masjid mein teer liye guzar raha tha farmaya: In ke phalon ko pakar lo? Unhon ne kaha: Han."
"1286","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ne hamen khabar di, ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Humare bare mein, Banu Harithah aur Banu Salimah ke bare mein, nazil hui: Jab tum mein se do jamaten himmat harne lagi thin, aur main ye pasand na karunga ke woh nazil na hui hoti, Allah Azz wa Jall ke is farman ki wajah se: Aur Allah un ka Muhafiz tha."
"1287","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jabir ibn Abdullah ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne humen ghore ka gosht khilaya aur humen gadhe ke gosht se mana farmaya."
"1288","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jabir ibn Abdullah ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne muzaraat se mana farmaya. Sufyan ne kaha: Har woh cheez jo main ne Amr ibn Dinar se suni jis mein unhon ne hum se kaha: Main ne Jabir ko suna, siwaye in do riwayaton ke, yani ghore ke gosht aur muzaraat ki, main nahin janta ke in mein un ke aur Jabir ke darmiyan koi hai ya nahin; rahi teeron wali riwayat, to main ne khud un se kaha: Kya aap ne Jabir se suna? Us ke mutabiq jo main ne aap ko bayan kiya."
"1289","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulayman ibn Yasar ne hamen khabar di: Tariq hakim tha, aur us ne faisla kiya ke umra waris ko milti hai, Jabir ibn Abdullah ke qaul ki bunyad par, Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se."
"1290","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Hum azl kiya karte the jab ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam hamare darmiyan maujud the aur Quran nazil ho raha tha."
"1291","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn Hassan ne hum se bayan kiya, Urwah ibn Iyad se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se jo Banu Salimah ke bhai hain: Ek shakhs Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein aaya aur arz kiya: Ya Rasool Allah, mere paas ek laundi hai aur main us se azl karta hun, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Woh us cheez ko nahin rok sakta jise Allah Azza wa Jalla ne muqaddar farma diya ho, unhon ne kaha: Woh shakhs chala gaya aur abhi thodi hi muddat guzri thi ke woh Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein aaya aur arz kiya: Ya Rasool Allah, kya Aap jante hain ke woh laundi haamila ho gayi hai, Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Main Allah ka banda aur Us ka Rasool hun."
"1292","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Jab ye nazil hua: Farmaiye: Woh Qadir hai ke tum par tumhare upar se azab bheje, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Main Tere Chehre ki panah mangta hun, ya tumhare pairon ke neeche se, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Main Tere Chehre ki panah mangta hun, ya tumhein girohon mein uljha de aur tum mein se baaz ko baaz ki sakhti ka maza chakhaye, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ye dono halki hain, ya ye dono aasan hain."
"1293","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata ibn Abi Rabah se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke zamane mein qurbani ke gosht ka tosha Madinah ki taraf le jaya karte the."
"1294","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Mere walid Uhud ke din shaheed kiye gaye aur Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein laye gaye aur Aap ke samne rakh diye gaye, un ka musla kiya gaya tha, Maine un se kapda hatana chaha to meri qaum ne mujhe mana kiya, aur Maine un se kapda hatana chaha jabke meri qaum mujhe mana karti rahi, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne hukm farmaya ke unhein uthaya jaye, phir Aap ne rone wali aurat ki awaz suni aur farmaya: Ye kaun hai, logon ne kaha: Amr ki beti, ya Amr ki behan, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Mat ro, ya woh kyun roti hai, farishte un par salam ho apne paron se un par saya kiye rahe yahan tak ke unhein uthaya gaya, Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Munkadir is riwayat mein hamesha shak karte the."
"1295","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Ibn al-Munkadir ko farmate hue suna: Maine Jabir ibn Abdullah ko farmate hue suna: Yahud kaha karte the: Jo shakhs apni biwi ke paas peeche se us ke aage mein aaye to bachcha bhenga paida hoga, to Allah Azza wa Jalla ne nazil farmaya: Tumhari biwiyan tumhare liye kheti hain, pas apni kheti mein jis tarah chaho aao."
"1296","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ja'far ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam halat-e-janabat mein apne sar par pani ke teen chullu dala karte the."
"1297","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Muhammad ibn Ali ibn Rabi'ah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Aqil ibn Abi Talib se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujh se farmaya: Ae Jabir, kya tum jante ho ke Allah Azza wa Jalla ne tumhare walid ko zinda farmaya aur un se farmaya: Tamanna karo. Unhon ne arz kiya: Ke mujhe dobara zinda kiya jaye aur Teri rah mein phir qatal kiya jaaun. To Us ne farmaya: Maine faisla farma diya hai ke woh wapas nahi lautenge."
"1298","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Aqil ne mujh se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko farmate hue suna: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Ansar ki ek khatun ke paas tashreef laye, to us ne un ke liye apni ek chatai bichhai, woh chatai ghane khajur ke darakht the, aur un ke liye ek bakri zibah ki; to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne us mein se khaya. Phir Zuhr ka waqt hua, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam khade hue, wuzu farmaya, phir Zuhr parhi. Phir bakri ka baqi hissa laya gaya to unhon ne us mein se khaya, phir Asr ke liye baghair wuzu kiye khade hue. Phir main Abu Bakr al-Siddiq Raziallahu Anhu ke paas aaya, to unhon ne apne ghar walon se farmaya: Kya tumhare paas kuch hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir tumhari doodh dene wali bakri kahan hai? To woh lai gai aur unhon ne us ka doodh doha aur us se hamare liye pheosi banai; unhon ne us mein se khaya aur hum ne khaya. Phir namaz ke liye khade hue aur baghair wuzu kiye namaz parhi. Phir main Umar ibn al-Khattab Raziallahu Anhu ke paas aaya, aur do chullu laye gaye; ek un ke saamne rakha gaya aur dusra un ke peeche. Unhon ne khaya aur hum ne khaya, phir baghair wuzu kiye namaz parhi."
"1299","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ja'far ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se: Jab Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Baitullah ka tawaf farmaya aur Maqam ke peeche do rak'atein parhein, to Pathar ki taraf lautey aur use chhua, phir al-Safa ki taraf nikle aur farmaya: Hum us se ibtida karte hain jis se Allah ne ibtida farmai: Beshak al-Safa aur al-Marwah Allah ki nishaniyon mein se hain."
"1300","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ja'far ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se, unhon ne farmaya: Jab Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke qadam wadi mein utre to unhon ne tezi farmai yahan tak ke wadi ko paar kar liya."
"1301","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ja'far ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne sau oonton ki qurbani pesh ki; Ali Alaihis Salam Yaman se aaye to unhon ne unhen apne oonton mein teesre hisse mein shareek kiya; Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne chhiyasath oont zibah kiye aur Ali ko hukm diya to unhon ne chautis zibah kiye; Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne har zibah shuda oont me se ek tukde ka hukm diya jo pakaya gaya, to unhon ne gosht khaya aur shorbe ki chuskiyan leen; Sufyan ne farmaya: Ahl-e-Arab kehte hain: Aur unhon ne chuskiyan leen."
"1302","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zubayr ne hum se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Koi shehri kisi dehati ke liye farokht na kare; logon ko chhor do, Allah un mein se baaz ko baaz ke zariye rizq dega."
"1303","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zubayr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Al-Ji'ranah me Hunayn ka maal-e-ghanimat taqseem farma rahe thay aur Bilal ki god me kacha sona tha ke ek shakhs Aap ke paas aaya aur bola: Ae Muhammad, insaf karo kyunke tum ne insaf nahin kiya; unhon ne farmaya: Tujh par afsos, agar main insaf na karun to kaun insaf karega; Umar ibn al-Khattab Raziallahu Anhu khade hue aur bole: Ae Allah ke Rasul, mujhe ijazat dijiye ke main is munafiq ki gardan maar dun; Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ise chhor do kyunke is ke sathi hain, ya sathiyon me se hai, jo Quran parhte hain magar woh un ke halqon se nahin guzarta; woh deen se is tarah nikal jate hain jaise teer shikar se paar ho jata hai."
"1304","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zubayr ne hum se ek do martaba se zyada bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tum me se jis ke paas zameen ya khajoor ke darakht hon woh use farokht na kare hatta ke use apne shareek par pesh kar de; Sufyan ne farmaya: Kufi log Abu al-Zubayr ke paas is riwayat ke bare me poochne aate thay, kehte hue: Ibn Abi Layla ne hum se tumhare hawale se yeh bayan kiya."
"1305","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zubayr ne hum se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Isha ke andhere me apne bachon ko andar rok lo aur logon ke aaram ke liye letne ke baad raat ko baatein karne se bacho kyunke tum nahin jante ke Allah apni makhlooq me se kya bhejta hai; pas darwaze band karo, chiragh bujha do, bartanon ko aundha kar do aur mashkizon ke munh bandh do."
"1306","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zubayr ne hum se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman aisa nahin jo kheti lagaye jisme se insan, jinn, parinda, wehshi janwar, darinda, sawari ka janwar ya koi cheez khaye magar woh us ke liye sadqa hoga."
"1307","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zubayr ne hum se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Hum ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se maut par bai'at nahin ki thi balke hum ne un se is par bai'at ki thi ke hum farar nahin honge."
"1308","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zubayr ne hum se bayan kiya, Jabir se, ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Behtareen namaz woh hai jisme qiyam lamba ho, behtareen jihad us ka hai jiska khoon bahaya jaye aur jiska ghora kaata jaye, aur behtareen sadqa kam maal wale ki mehnat hai ya jo guzare ke bawajud diya jaye."
"1309","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zubayr ne hum se bayan kiya, Jabir ibn Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne logon ko bai'at ke liye bulaya to unhon ne hum me se Al-Jadd ibn Qays nam ka ek shakhs paya jo apne oont ke pet ke neeche chhupa hua tha."
"1310","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zubayr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko suna jab un se lehsan ke bare me poocha gaya, keh rahe thay: Us din hamari zameen me lehsan nahin tha; sirf pyaaz aur gandana mana kiya gaya tha."
"1311","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Abu al-Zubayr se suna, woh Jabir ibn Abdullah se riwayat karte hain: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne afat se hone wale nuqsan ko muaf kar dene ka kisi andaz se zikr farmaya. Sufyan ne kaha: mujhe sirf itna yaad hai ke unhon ne us ki muafi ka zikr farmaya tha, aur mujhe yaad nahin ke woh muafi kitni thi."
"1312","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Humayd ibn Qays ne bayan kiya, woh Sulayman ibn Atiq se, woh Jabir ibn Abdullah se, woh Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi mafhoom ki riwayat karte hain."
"1313","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Humayd ibn Qays ne bayan kiya, woh Sulayman ibn Atiq se, woh Jabir ibn Abdullah se riwayat karte hain: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne barson ki bea se mana farmaya."
"1314","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, woh Abu al-Zubayr se, woh Jabir se, woh Nabi se isi mafhoom ki riwayat karte hain."
"1315","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir se: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke liye mashkize me Nabidh banaya jata tha, aur agar mashkiza na milta to pathar ke hauz me."
"1316","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir se, ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne singhi lagane wale ki kamai ke bare me farmaya: Use pani dhone wale oont ko khila do."
"1317","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir se, unhon ne farmaya: Main Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath ek safar me tha, aur Aap mujhe aa mile jabke main apne pani dhone wale oonton me se ek oont par sawar tha jo sust lag raha tha, to main ne kaha: Haye meri maa ka gham! Hamare pas hamesha hi naqis pani wala oont hota hai, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne use apni chhari se kuredha jo Aap ke pas thi, ya tek wali lathi se, aur main ne use aisa dekha ke shayad hi koi cheez us se aage nikalti."
"1318","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir se, ke ek shakhs ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, main ne khwab me dekha goya meri gardan kat di gayi, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tum me se koi Shaitan ke us se khelne ko kyun bayan karta hai?"
"1319","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Misar ne hum se bayan kiya, Muharib ibn Dithar se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mera haq ada kiya aur mujhe zyada diya."
"1320","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Jafar ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Jabir se, unhon ne farmaya: Logon me elan kiya gaya ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Hajj ka irada kiya hai, aur Madina bhar gaya, to Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Hajj ke mausam me aur Hajj ke waqt rawana hue, aur jab Aap ne al-Bayda par nazar dali to us se buland awaz se talbiya kaha, aur logon ne Aap ke sath talbiya kaha."
"1321","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jafar ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Madina se roze ki halat me nikle hatta ke jab Kura al-Ghamim me pahunche to ek bartan uthaya, use apni hatheli par rakha jabke apni sawari par the, apne se aage walon ko rok liya hatta ke peeche wale aa mile, phir piya jabke log unhe dekh rahe the, phir aap ko khabar pahunchi ke kuch logon ne roza rakha tha, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Yehi nafarman hain."
"1322","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata ibn Abi Rabah se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ruqba aur umra na karo, pas jise ruqba ya umra ke taur par kuch diya gaya to wo wirasat ke raste par chalega."
"1323","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Najashi ka inteqal hua to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Aaj ek nek banda faut hua hai, pas khare ho jao aur Ashamah par namaz parho."
"1324","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne muzabana, muhaqala aur mukhabara se mana farmaya, aur is se ke khajooren farokht na ki jayen jab tak un ki durusti zahir na ho jaye, aur ke wo dinar ya dirham ke siwa kisi cheez ke badle farokht na ki jayen, lekin arayas ki ijazat di, aur mukhabara zameen ko teesre ya chauthe hisse par kiraye par dena hai, aur muhaqala khari fasal ko gehun ke badle bechna hai, aur muzabana darakht par lage phal ko chuni hui khajooron ke badle bechna hai."
"1325","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Makkah chauth ki subah pahunche, aur Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Agar mujhe pehle maloom hota jo ab mujhe maloom hua hai to main wo na karta jo maine kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aur aap ne apne sahaba ko ihram kholne ka hukm diya, to unhon ne kaha: Kaisa ihlal ho, unhon ne kaha: Mukammal ihlal ho, Umra Qayamat ke din tak Hajj me dakhil ho gaya hai."
"1326","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujalid ibn Said al-Hamdani ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Shabi se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Fadak walon me se ek shakhs ne zina kiya, to Fadak walon ne Madina me kuch Yahudiyon ko likha: Muhammad se is ke bare me poocho, agar wo tumhen kore marne ka hukm den to wo un se le lena, aur agar wo tumhen rajm ka hukm den to wo un se na lena, pas unhon ne aap se is ke bare me poocha, to aap ne farmaya: Mere pas apne do sab se zyada aalim shakhs bhejo, to wo Ibn Suriya nam ka ek kana shakhs aur ek doosra shakhs laye, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne un se farmaya: Kya tum apne peeche walon me sab se zyada aalim ho, unhon ne kaha: Hamari qaum ne hamen is ke liye muntakhab kiya hai, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne un se farmaya: Kya tumhare pas Taurat nahi hai jis me Allah Taala ka hukm hai, unhon ne kaha: Haan, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Main tumhen Us Zaat ki qasam deta hun Jis ne Bani Israil ke liye samandar ko cheer diya, tum par badalon ka saya kiya, tumhen Aal-e-Firaun se nijat di, aur Bani Israil par mann aur salwa utara: Taurat me rajm ke bare me kya pate ho, to un me se ek ne doosre se kaha: Mujhe is jaisi qasam kabhi nahi di gayi, phir unhon ne kaha: Hum bar bar dekhne ko zina pate hain, aur bosa-o-kinar ko zina pate hain, aur bos-o-kinar ko zina pate hain, lekin jab char gawah gawahi den ke unhon ne use andar jate aur bahar aate dekha hai jaise surma ki salai surmedani me dakhil hoti hai to rajm wajib ho jata hai, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Baat yehi hai, pas aap ne us ke bare me hukm diya aur use rajm kiya gaya, aur nazil hua: Agar ye tumhare pas aayen to un ke darmiyan faisla karo ya un se munh pher lo, aur agar tum un se munh pher loge to wo tumhen kuch nuqsan nahi pahuncha sakenge, lekin agar tum faisla karo to un ke darmiyan insaf se faisla karo, aayat ke aakhir tak."
"1327","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zakariyya ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Shabi se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se, Allah Azzawajal ke farman ke bare me: Jhoot sunne wale, se murad Madina ke Yahudi hain, doosre logon ke liye sunne wale, se murad Fadak wale hain, jo tumhare pas nahi aaye, kalimon ko un ki jagahon se badalte hain, se murad Fadak wale hain, kehte hain: Agar tumhen ye kore marna diya jaye to use le lo, aur agar tumhen ye na diya jaye to rajm se bacho."
"1328","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujalid ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Shabi se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Maine guzishta raat khud ko dekha goya ek shakhs ne mujhe khajoor ka ek tukra khilaya, maine use chabaya to us me guthli payi jis ne mujhe takleef di, pas maine use thook diya, phir us ne mujhe ek aur tukra khilaya, aur wahi hua, phir ek aur, aur wahi hua, to Abu Bakr al-Siddiq Radi Allahu Anhu ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe is ki tabir karne dijiye, aap ne farmaya: Tabir karo, unhon ne kaha: Ye wo lashkar hai jise aap ne bheja hai, Allah unhe mehfooz rakhega aur unhe ghanimat dega, phir wo ek shakhs se milenge jo aap ki panah ka wasta dega to wo use chhor denge, phir wo ek aur se milenge jo aap ki panah ka wasta dega to wo use chhor denge, phir wo ek aur se milenge jo aap ki panah ka wasta dega to wo use chhor denge, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ay Abu Bakr, farishte ne isi tarah kaha hai."
"1329","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Aswad ibn Qays ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Nubayh al-Anazi ko kehte suna: Maine Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne safar se wapsi par raat ko aurton ke pas aane se hamen mana farmaya, phir hum is ke baad raat ko un ke pas gaye."
"1330","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Aswad ibn Qays ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Nubayh al-Anazi ko kehte suna: Maine Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Uhud ke shaheedon ke bare me hukm diya ke unhen un ke marqadon ki taraf lautaya jaye, un me se jo uthaye gaye the un samet."
"1331","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Aziz ibn Muhammad se, Ibrahim ibn Ismail ibn Mujammi se, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se, ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum ye sabz tarkari khao to hamare sath majlis me na baitho, kyunke farishte us cheez se aziyat pate hain jis se log aziyat pate hain."
"1332","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Salih ibn Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, jo apne walid se behtar tha, al-Shabi se, unhon ne farmaya: Ek shakhs se kaha gaya: Hamein apna taaruf karao, to us ne kaha: Tumhara daftar-nawes to bas sakht-kho, bakhil, maila-kuchaila, harees, chaatne wala hai, ke jab use kaha jaye: Lo, ek luqma lo, to jhapatta hai, aur jab kaha jaye: Do, to rok leta hai."
"1333","Bishr ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hamare nazdeek Sunnat ye hai ke aadmi taqdeer par iman laye, us ki bhalai aur us ki burai, us ki mithas aur us ki karwahat par, aur ye jane ke jo use pahuncha wo use chookne wala kabhi na tha, aur jo use chook gaya wo use pahunchen wala kabhi na tha, aur ye ke ye sab Allah Azz wa Jalla ki taraf se taqdeer hai, aur ye ke iman qaul aur amal hai, badhta aur ghatta hai; koi qaul amal ke baghair faida nahi deta, aur na qaul aur amal niyyat ke baghair, aur na niyyat ke sath qaul aur amal Sunnat ki pairwi ke baghair, aur Muhammad Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke tamam sahaba ke liye rehmat ki dua karna, kyunke Allah Azz wa Jalla ne farmaya: Aur jo un ke baad aaye kehte hain: Ae hamare Rab, hamein bakhsh de aur hamare bhaiyon ko jo hum se pehle iman laye, hamein sirf un ke liye maghfirat talab karne ka hukm diya gaya hai; to jo unhein bura kahe ya unhein haqeer jane ya un me se kisi ek ko, wo Sunnat par nahi, aur fay me us ka koi haq nahi, hamein ek se zyada ne khabar di, Malik ibn Anas se, ke unhon ne farmaya: Allah Taala ne fay taqseem kiya aur farmaya: Faqir Muhajirin ke liye jo apne gharon se nikale gaye, phir Farmaya: Aur jo un ke baad aaye kehte hain: Ae hamare Rab, hamein bakhsh de aur hamare bhaiyon ko, ayat ke akhir tak, to jo un ke liye ye na kahe wo un logon me se nahi jin ke liye fay muqarrar kiya gaya, aur Quran Allah ka kalam hai; main ne Sufyan ko kehte suna: Quran Allah ka kalam hai, aur jo kahe ke wo makhlooq hai wo bidati hai; hum ne kabhi kisi ko ye kehte nahi suna, aur main ne Sufyan ko kehte suna: Iman qaul aur amal hai, badhta aur ghatta hai, to un ke bhai Ibrahim ibn Uyaynah ne un se kaha: Ae Abu Muhammad, Ghatta hai na kahiye, to wo ghussa hue aur farmaya: Khamosh raho ladke; haan, yahan tak ke us me se kuch bhi baqi na rahe, aur maut ke baad Deedar ka iqrar, aur har us cheez ka jo Quran aur hadith ne kahi, jaise: Aur Yahud ne kaha: Allah ka hath bandha hua hai; un ke hath bandhe jayein, aur jaise: Aur aasman Us ke Dayein Hath me lapete hue hain, aur jo is jaisa Quran aur hadith me hai; hum na us me izafa karte hain na us ki taweel karte hain; hum wahan rukte hain jahan Quran aur Sunnat ruke, aur hum kehte hain: Rehman Arsh par mustawi hua, jo is ke siwa kuch dawa kare wo munkir hai, Jahmi hai, aur ye ke koi na kahe jaisa Khawarij ne kaha: Jo kabira gunah kare wo kafir ho gaya, aur hum kisi gunah ki wajah se kisi ko kafir qarar nahi dete; kufr sirf un paanch ko chhorne me hai jin par Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya Islam ki bunyad hai: Gawahi dena ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasul hain, aur namaz qaim karna, aur zakat dena, aur Ramazan ke roze rakhna, aur Baitullah ka Hajj karna, lekin un me se teen ke bare me, jo unhein chhore us se jhagda nahi kiya jayega: jo gawahi na de, aur namaz na padhe, aur roza na rakhe, kyunke in me se koi cheez kabhi apne waqt se muakhkhar nahi hoti, aur apne waqt se jan-boojh kar kotahi ke baad us ki qaza use kafi nahi hoti, lekin zakat, jab bhi koi use ada kare wo use kafi hai, halanke wo use rokne me gunahgar tha, lekin Hajj, jo us ka zimmedar ho aur us tak rasta paye to wo us par wajib hai, magar us par usi saal me aisa lazim nahi ke us ke liye koi chara na ho; jab bhi wo use ada kare us ne use ada kar diya, aur jab us ne use ada kar diya to use muakhkhar karne me gunahgar na tha, jaisa wo zakat ke bare me gunahgar tha, kyunke zakat faqir Musalmanon ka haq hai jo us ne un se rok liya, to wo gunahgar raha yahan tak ke wo un tak pahunch jaye, lekin Hajj, wo us ke aur us ke Rab ke darmiyan tha; jab us ne use ada kiya to us ne use ada kar diya, aur agar wo sahib-e-isteaat aur qadir hote hue baghair Hajj kiye mar jaye to wo duniya me wapas lautne ka sawal karega taake Hajj kare, aur us ke ghar walon ko us ki taraf se Hajj karna chahiye, aur hum umeed rakhte hain ke ye use kafi hoga, jaise agar us par qarz ho jo us ki maut ke baad us ki taraf se ada kar diya gaya."
